---

<section class="fullwidth-section legal-section-clean" id="legalitas">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="legal-header-clean">
      <span class="legal-tag-clean red-text">KEABSAHAN LEGALITAS HUKUM</span>
      <h2 class="legal-title-clean">
        Perusahaan Resmi <span class="red-text">Terdaftar di Kemenkumham RI</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="legal-intro-clean">
        Legalitas bisnis <strong>PT CHAIN ASIA CONECT</strong> telah terdaftar resmi sebagai PT Perorangan pada <strong>1 September 2026</strong>. Keabsahan legal hukum ini merupakan posisi tawar profesional perusahaan sebagai mitra bisnis yang transparan, andal, dan terpercaya.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Credentials Stack (Clean Rows, No Card Boxes) -->
    <div class="legal-credentials-clean">
      <div class="cred-clean-row">
        <span class="cred-clean-label">SK KEMENKUMHAM RI</span>
        <div class="cred-clean-body">
          <strong class="cred-clean-val red-text">AHU-A117353.AH.01.30.Tahun 2026</strong>
          <span class="cred-clean-desc">Ditetapkan resmi di Jakarta pada tanggal 29 Agustus 2026.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cred-clean-row">
        <span class="cred-clean-label">NIB (NOMOR INDUK BERUSAHA)</span>
        <div class="cred-clean-body">
          <strong class="cred-clean-val red-text">0709260109599</strong>
          <span class="cred-clean-desc">KBLI 62193 (Aktivitas Pengembangan Aplikasi Berbasis Teknologi Blockchain & Rantai Pasok).</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cred-clean-row">
        <span class="cred-clean-label">NPWP WAJIB PAJAK BADAN</span>
        <div class="cred-clean-body">
          <strong class="cred-clean-val red-text">10.000.000.1-094.6336</strong>
          <span class="cred-clean-desc">Terdaftar resmi pada Direktorat Jenderal Pajak Republik Indonesia.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cred-clean-row">
        <span class="cred-clean-label">STATUS RESMI</span>
        <div class="cred-clean-body">
          <strong class="cred-clean-val" style="color: #16a34a;">TERDAFTAR LEGAL & AKTIF</strong>
          <span class="cred-clean-desc">Entitas PT Perorangan Resmi Terdaftar di Republik Indonesia.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .legal-section-clean {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .legal-header-clean {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .legal-tag-clean {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .legal-title-clean {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.8rem);
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }

  .legal-intro-clean {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-body);
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
  }

  .legal-credentials-clean {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .cred-clean-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  }

  .cred-clean-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .cred-clean-label {
    width: 220px;
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .cred-clean-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .cred-clean-val {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cred-clean-desc {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cred-clean-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }
    .cred-clean-label {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
